& [CanonicalRecord: FSC3FinalSlices] is the processed planning authority for FSC3 final work slices
  + [canonical_uuid] is 75d28b82-7ade-42d6-88c4-4c5fe555416c
  + [source_manifest_uuid] is 500f8095-5f6a-4e0a-b0fb-7503dc0040ed
  + [exploded_uuid] is b4ac8dad-2b87-447a-9cbe-eda33f57676f
  + [slice_surface_uuid] is 337e3bba-9048-4e1b-8011-479742b35c15
  + [authority_scope] is FSC3 slice order, slice readiness, slice gates, model routing, expected outputs, and verification oracles
  + [implementation_scope] is final slice planning authority only
  + [depends_on] is docs/planning/FSC2_Planning_Coordination_Pack.v1.sop

  = must: use docs/slices/FSC3_Final_Slices.v1.sop as the current FSC3 slice surface
  = must: execute FSC3-S01 first
  = must: run completion review after each slice before opening the next gated slice
  = must: keep FSC4 and FSC5 work gated until FSC3-S06 accepts the runtime graph proof pack
  - never: treat FSC3 slice records as implementation proof

& [CanonicalFSC3SliceSet] is the final FSC3 slice sequence
  + [slice] is FSC3-S01 runtime boundary and invariant map
  + [slice] is FSC3-S02 WholeFieldPlannerGraph contract and checkpoint policy
  + [slice] is FSC3-S03 SOP-first interrupt and resume contract
  + [slice] is FSC3-S04 operator trace runtime proof contract
  + [slice] is FSC3-S05 runtime graph fixture plan
  + [slice] is FSC3-S06 FSC3 completion review and activation packet

  = must: preserve this order unless completion review rebakes FSC3
  = must: mark downstream slices stale when an upstream accepted output changes

& [CanonicalFSC3ExecutionGate] is the activation rule for FSC3
  + [current_ready_slice] is FSC3-S01
  + [gated_slice] is FSC3-S02 until FSC3-S01 accepted
  + [gated_slice] is FSC3-S03 until FSC3-S02 accepted
  + [gated_slice] is FSC3-S04 until FSC3-S03 accepted
  + [gated_slice] is FSC3-S05 until FSC3-S04 accepted
  + [gated_slice] is FSC3-S06 until FSC3-S05 accepted
  + [completion_gate] is FSC3 runtime graph proof pack accepted after FSC3-S06

  = must: expose only FSC3-S01 as ready right now
  = must: keep all later slices gated inside FSC3

& [CanonicalFSC3ModelRouting] is the model-routing record
  + [FSC3-S01] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [FSC3-S02] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [FSC3-S03] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [FSC3-S04] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [FSC3-S05] is GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark-suitable after FSC3-S01 through FSC3-S04 are accepted
  + [FSC3-S06] is requires deeper reasoning

  = must: keep checkpoint authority, interrupt semantics, trace proof, and final runtime graph acceptance under deeper reasoning
  = should: route fixture drafting to GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark only after FSC3 contracts stabilize

